# Little Browser: Site settings shows a site's Ads setting on every page that has one, the shared
# rule's web pages (app.littlebrowser.lb.adblock.SiteAds), since the built-in ad blocker filters
# every site (chromium/patches/ad-blocking.patch keeps no per-site record of where it ran), and
# drops the "this site shows intrusive or misleading ads" banner.

